  "user": "Amount 240 euro, as I said at the start.",
  "answer": "You're right, the amount is EUR 240. My earlier summary said EUR 180, which was wrong. I've also re-checked the dates, and the deadline I gave before was not accurate.\n\nYour account (ACC-1005) shows two settled card charges to TechMart Online for EUR 240 each:\n\n- **TX-0402**, 14 July 2026, EUR 240.00\n- **TX-0401**, 20 July 2026, EUR 240.00\n\nEligibility results:\n\n- **service_not_rendered:** eligible. The window is 90 days, with a deadline of **18 October 2026**.\n- **duplicate_charge:** eligible. The window is 60 days, with a deadline of **18 September 2026**.\n\nBefore I file anything, please confirm:\n\n1. **Which charge?** TX-0401 (20 July) or TX-0402 (14 July).\n2. **Reason code?** `service_not_rendered` if you did not receive the service or goods. `duplicate_charge` if you were charged twice for the same purchase and received it only once.\n3. **Amount:** EUR 240.00, the full transaction amount.\n\nFiling is irreversible, so reply with the transaction, the reason code, and \"yes, open the dispute,\" and I'll file it.",
